### Users: user/user (ROLE_USER), manager/manager (ROLE_MANAGER), admin/admin (ROLE_ADMIN)
### Rules: GET - all roles | POST, PUT - MANAGER, ADMIN | DELETE - ADMIN only

###1. USER: GET all transfers -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

###

###2. USER: GET one transfer -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/1
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

###

###3. USER: CREATE transfer -> 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic user user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Galatasaray",
  "transferFee": 75000000
}

###

###4. USER: DELETE transfer -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/1
Authorization: Basic user user

###

###5. MANAGER: CREATE transfer -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic manager manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Galatasaray",
  "transferFee": 75000000
}

###

###6. MANAGER: UPDATE transfer -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic manager manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Chelsea",
  "transferFee": 80000000
}

###

###7. MANAGER: DELETE transfer -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/4
Authorization: Basic manager manager

###

###8. ADMIN: GET all transfers -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

###9. ADMIN: DELETE transfer -> 200
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin

###

###10. NO AUTH: GET all transfers -> 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Accept: application/json

###
